window.products.push({"id":1158026,"name":"Heuck Deluxe Heavy Duty Ice Cream Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M74X7xKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Heuck deluxe heavy duty ice cream scoop is built to reduce strain on your wrists and easily scoop even the hardest ice cream. Works equally well for forming meatballs and cookie dough or for portioning foods like rice and vegetables. Sturdy, non-slip grip makes it easy to hold and the trigger-released steel band quickly releases the food beneath it. Hand wash only. All purpose scoop perfect for serving and portioning all types of foods including ice cream, frozen yogurt, cookie dough, meat balls, and other entrees Sturdy construction helps you scoop hard ice cream without additional strain on your hands and wrists Spring-action trigger releases a stainless-steel band that releases the food beneath it Easy to clean by hand washing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M74X7xKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heuck","source_asin":"B009OYUHCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009OYUHCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009OYUHCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158027,"name":"BedStory King Mattress, 12 Inch Gel & Bamboo Charcoal Infused Memory Foam Mattress, Medium Firm Mattress in a Box, Premium Bed Mattress with Breathabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714jTu6nLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-layer Foam Mattress: BedStory 12’’ mattress is designed with 6-layer foam system, that contains two layers memory foam to conform your body shape, one layer wave foam and one layer special cutting foam for good ventilation, two layers high density foam to offer enough support. This design helps your body integrated with the mattress much better, helping to relieve fatigue and bring you a more comfortable sleep. Pain Relief Mattress: The Memory Foam Mattress perfectly conform to your body shape and relieve the pressure of your joint points. To create a better sleeping environment, the memory foam layer is infused with gel and bamboo charcoal, the gel can help to regulate your body temperature and the bamboo charcoal can easily absorb odor and moisture. Breathable and Washable Cover: This memory foam mattress comes with a skin-friendly 3D knitted zippered cover, it is easy to taken off and machine washed, no need special treatment, save your time on cleaning it. Safe and Secure: All the Foams in BedStory mattress have been certified by CertiPUR-US, which means that this mattress does not contain any harmful substances, environmental friendly and durable. The mattress also meets the CFR1633 standard, which makes it not easy to be burned, so it is safe to use. MATTRESS IN A BOX | The memory foam mattress is compressed, rolled, and vacuum-sealed in a single box for convenient delivery and setup. You can carry the box with your partner. Once unpack the mattress, it usually take 48-72 hours to fully expand, sizes are subject to ±0.5 Inches, but it may take longer due to other factors, like cold weather. Feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714jTu6nLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BedStory","source_asin":"B08XZ58Y12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZ58Y12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZ58Y12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
