window.products.push({"id":1158173,"name":"Tidy Books® Kids Book Rack Storage (Age 3-10) Wooden Book Caddy, Removable Teaching Clock, Kids Book Storage Organizer, Grey, 13.8 x 21.7 x 12.2 in, E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":116.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RvzU2AT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💚 WANT TO GET YOUR CHILD OFF SCREENS AND INTO BOOKS? Create an enticing reading nook with the Tidy Books Box. I designed this portable kids book storage box so kids could keep their favourite books anywhere in the house. My wooden kids book caddy is double sided so kids can pick out books from both sides. The removable teaching clock gives children a lovely introduction to telling the time. Safe and easy for toddlers to use independently. The award winning design by a mom for her children. 💚 BUILT AND DESIGNED TO LAST. I aim for all my designs to be a long lasting investment. As your child grows remove the wooden teaching time clock and this kids book storage box becomes a grown up magazine rack and book storage organiser. Holds up to 40 picture books of all shapes & sizes. The original Tidy Books book caddy may be more expensive than the imitations, but its sturdy, classic design means it will be a lasting family member. Self assembly. 💚 AWARD WINNING, LOVED BY PARENTS & GRANDPARENTS WORLDWIDE. I created the retro Tidy Books Box for my own children because I wanted them to have their favourite books to hand anywhere in the house. My original Tidy Books Bookcase and portable Book Box changed the way kids books are presented in the home. Join parents and grandparents worldwide who want to instill a love of books. Our bedside book caddy is ideal for your child's early years and will make books a natural part of their world. 💚 ECO-FRIENDLY, HANDMADE, WOODEN MONTESSORI BOOK CADDY Each handmade item is individual with a natural craft look in style and finish. Made from sustainable plywood. No MDF. Non toxic water lacquer finish (low VOCs ) My background as a violin maker means I am passionate about how products are made. We could have coated them with a solvent based acrylic lacquer, but I made an ethical choice. Water lacquer shows the natural imperfections in the wood, and is better for the planet and your kids. 💚 SHOP SMALL & SUSTAINABLY. At Tidy Books we believe that when you shop thoughtfully, your purchase will last you a lifetime, meaning less landfill and shipping. THE ORIGINAL SINCE 2004. Bookshelves for kids room and other nursery storage furniture, designed by founder and mom Geraldine to foster kids independence, and supports childrens reading charity Coram Beanstalk. Tidy Books changed the way kids books are presented in the home to encourage a love of books from an early age. Choose well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RvzU2AT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tidy Books","source_asin":"B07C8QW9C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C8QW9C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C8QW9C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
