window.products.push({"id":1158218,"name":"Robe & Towel Hook, Coat and Hat Wall Hooks in Heavy Duty Coated Stainless for Indoor and Outdoor Use - 6 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616mMDP-lLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It made sense the old name for this is the \"Hat and Coat\" hook. After all, the design of this double-pronged hook is sturdy enough to hold a heavy winter coat with gloves stuffed in the pockets, a thick scarf, and a winter hat on the top prong. The fact this hook is still popular today speaks to its reliable design and many uses in today's world. Sure, it is still a marvelous hook for hats and coats. But the fact is, the hats are just as often baseball helmets, hockey masks, and even welder's hoods. And the coats just one thing the bottom prong is holding. Think gardening tools, towels, masks, flashlights on a lanyard, BBQ tools on cords, and full wardrobes. Line 6 of these hooks in a row for the perfect jacket and backpack rack for the kids. Drill them into the garage or workshop to organize all those tools and items you want to organize but keep in sight. Hang a few in the yard for a small garden hose or to keep power cords organized in the shed. Don't forget to put a few in your farmhouse kitchen or your urban bathroom. The uses are endless whether you want a place to hang your hat, rest a cane, or organize your gym bag and workout clothes. Count on this traditional design and our craftsmanship to add reliable organization to your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616mMDP-lLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piffny","source_asin":"B092JP1DWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JP1DWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JP1DWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
