window.products.push({"id":1158282,"name":"Neatness Large Salad Spinner with Drain, Bowl, and Colander - Quick and Easy Multi-Use Lettuce Spinner, Vegetable Dryer, Fruit Washer, Pasta and Fries","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dDO7hmwML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn chore into pleasure and make your salads tastier. Forget washing gem lettuce by hand, drying chopped salad with tons of paper towels, spraying water all around the kitchen, and bland, watery salads. Our easy rotary handle makes spinning effortless, so you can enjoy the convenience of a quick, mess-free, and tasty salad. 3-in-1 Multifunctional Kitchen Gadget. All parts are separated for easy use and cleaning. You can use the clear base as a serving bowl or salad mixer and the basket as a convenient colander or vegetable washing basket. That's more space in your cupboards and fewer dishes to wash. Built-In Drainage System. You can wash and dry greens, fruits, and vegetables, without removing the lid. Just add water through the lid as you spin-wash, tip salad spinner to pour out water through the opening in the lid, and spin again to remove excess water and dry. Smart Design. Non-skid base provides stability and control, so the bowl remains steady on your countertop while using the salad spinner dryer. Two locking clamps on the lid prevent water and greens from flying around your kitchen and making a mess. Not Just For Salad. Use it as a vegetable spinner when cleaning veggies or as a fruit washer before enjoying your berries. You can even use it to spin out any remaining water from pasta, so your sauces stick better, or to remove excess oil from french fries. It's one of the most useful gadgets in any kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dDO7hmwML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neatness","source_asin":"B0B5DDVJ7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5DDVJ7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5DDVJ7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158283,"name":"New Comfort 6 Stage UV HEPA Ozone Air Purifier with Remote and Warrant CH3000","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZTHqdUN-L._AC_.jpg","description":"New Comfort CH3000 6 stage Air Purifier Cleaner (Brand New). Washable HEPA, Charcoal, Powerful UV, Ozone, Ionic and more provide clean fresh air. LCD with Remote and 3 year factory warranty. This Air Purifier can be run with just normal filters or adjustable Ozone for reducing strong odors. This is the best Ozone air purifier that you can buy and comes in the really nice Cherry wood finish. With air purifiers their are typically 2 systems.  One is where a fan pulls dirty air through a series of air filters and cleans the air.   The other style is using Activated Oxygen or 03 which makes the air smell clean and nice but does not really remove the allergens from the air like the filter type of air purifiers.  The great thing about this air purifier is it is actually a perfect combination of both those systems.  Its washable filters safely and easily reduce contaminants, allergens, odors, mold spores and more from the air but if you have some serious odors that cleaned up you can also turn on the Ozone 03 feature to keep your air smelling clean and fresh. This high end New Comfort BH3000 (best model made) Air Purifier has 6 stages of purification, washable filters, 3 year warranty, works up to 3000 square feet leaving your air clean and fresh. DOES NOT MEET CALIFORNIA REQUIREMENTS, CAN NOT BE SHIPPED TO CALIFORNIA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZTHqdUN-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Comfort","source_asin":"B00BVF0NK0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BVF0NK0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BVF0NK0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
