window.products.push({"id":1158315,"name":"The Original Back in 1980 Poster USA (15.7x23.4 Unframed) in Elegant Gift Tube Happy 41st Anniversary 41 Wedding Decor Birthday Party Decorations Idea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z5V+3AmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR QUALITY - Our unframed 'Back in ...' posters are not only an amazing decoration, but they make for a memorable gift too! Our posters are made from high-quality materials and by utilizing modern printing methods. Design elements are highlighted using colored gold foils to make them stand out - and for that added pizzazz - while the rest of the poster is finished off using UV varnishing and matte lamination printing techniques, making things pop and look stunning. INFORMATIVE & EMOTIVE - Ever wanted to have or gift a decorative poster that doesn't just look amazing, but informative as well? Each Anavego \"Back in\" poster is filled with trivia about a specific year and was designed using the correct aesthetic elements of the decade - the ’60s is classy, ’70s is groovy, ’80s is flashy. Whichever year you choose to get, you will eventually read something that would make you smile, make you nod in agreement, or make you go wow. FUN DECORATIVE PIECE - Measuring in at 400 x 594 mm, our “Back in” posters are big enough to be used as a stand-alone decorative piece for your celebration or inside your room, office, business. Their bright colors and eye-catching layout will surely make them stand out and will elicit lively nostalgic conversations. Each set includes 8 removable double-sided adhesive strips. The strips are enough to put up the poster twice (using four strips each time) and they are removable. UNUSUAL GIFT IDEA - Looking for a unique way to surprise your friends and loved ones? Then our “Back in” poster might just be the gift you need. Not only is it a fun and unique gift to give on special occasions, but it also comes in an elegant giftable blue storage tube. It’s these little details that make our poster stand out - and why we’re sure that whoever receives it as a gift will love it - as well as appreciate your effort. BACK IN USA – This is the United States of America version of our “Back in” poster. The information was curated with a focus on US culture. You will see that we selected some of the most relevant facts, people and events, making the posters excellent for anyone from US or anyone who currently lives here. The backside of the posters is white so that you can write a greeting if you wish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z5V+3AmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anavego","source_asin":"B083B7SRLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083B7SRLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083B7SRLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
