window.products.push({"id":1158363,"name":"Letusto Premium Shoe Storage Boxes - Clear Plastic Shoes Throne Display Case (6 pack, Orange), Stackable Shelves Large Sneaker Containers with Lids + ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R6xczn+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: Overall size is large 14.2(L) x 11(W) x 8.5(H) inches, which is suitable for men's 14 size shoes. It also fits tall heels and high heel sneakers. Bonus Accessories: We have included a pack of 6 hygiene pads and shoe shapers so you can keep your shoes clean and enjoy longer use. Easy Installation: Installation is quick and simple. Simply follow the instructions and you will have it setup within minutes. Stackable: Each shoe box is perfectly stackable with each other. This will help you save space and design your livingroom, garage, or closet to match your needs. Sturdy and Durable: The plastic is made of ABS and PP with high hardness, which will protect it from any deformation throughout time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R6xczn+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Letusto","source_asin":"B08RYN9MSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYN9MSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYN9MSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158364,"name":"Brielle Home Cotton-Modal from Beech Blend Jersey Knitted Pillowcase Set (Standard Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yfPo4cWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brielle Modal-Cotton Blend Jerseys are the softest sheets in the market. Bringing best of Modal and Cotton together. This product line is discontinued, please search for \"Brielle 100-Percent Modal from Beech Jersey\" replacing this product line. What is Brielle? Brielle is our exclusive home textiles brand. In Brielle we distilled 60 years of expertise to deliver the best value in home textiles. We carry an extensive selection of bedding products with cotton, modal, tencel/lyocell, bamboo fibers in sateen jersey, twill and percale weaves. The selection of fabric, size and color options often are not offered by local stores and delivered to your door at your convenience. We also carry a wide selection of window panels. Whether you are shopping for a sheet set, window panels or bathrobe, Brielle will deliver the best product for your money. Luxury bedding and home textiles for factory prices. Guaranteed. What is Modal? This bedding product is made of Modal which is a high strength fiber, famous for its silky softness. Modal has a refined smooth touch, excellent breathability and moisture management features. We used the Lenzing Modal, Austrian produced Modal fiber, made of the natural cellulose from Beech wood trees of Europe. Lenzing Modal is manufactured with high sustainability and ecological standards. Austrians are known for their fancy high tech sport cars and idyllic mountain scenes. They did not fall short in the glamour department with this marvelous fiber. What is jersey? Jersey is the weave type of the fabric. This jersey bedding is knitted, like a fine T-shirt to provide a silky soft, feathery light touch to your skin, ensuring a good night's sleep. Coupled with Modal fabric's natural softness and sheen, you will not want to get out of bed. Jersey is the softest weave available for bedding. If you prefer a heavy duty fabric please search for Brielle Sateen or Brielle Twill collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yfPo4cWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brielle","source_asin":"B00BPZMXOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BPZMXOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BPZMXOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
