window.products.push({"id":1158456,"name":"Electric Pasta Maker Automatic Noodle Machine Spaghetti Macaroni Fettuccine Lasagna Bonus Ravioli Sausage Maker with Mixes, Kneads & Extrudes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UyiJHPqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍕Featured: - 260W zinc copper motor exerting 1600 pounds force- Creates about 1 pound of fresh pasta in 15 minutes- Stirring bar inside make the flour and liquid mixed evenly and thoroughly- 8 different shaping discs for various choice - Personalized meal with different ingredients and flour- Compact size to save your kitchen space- Automatic operation with mixes,kneads and extrudes- A storage drawer at the bottom store for the shaping discs and cleaning tools- Make cleaning easy with cleaning tools and the detachable components 🍕Detailed: Material:Plastic Color:White & Silver Dimension:16.5”(L) x 10”(W) x 11.8”(H) Weight:11 lbs Capacity:1 pound Power cable length: 35.8\" Rated power:260W 🍕Package content: 8 x Pasta shaping discs 1 x Ravioli accessory 1 x Cleaning tool  1 x Flour cup 1 x Water measuring cup 1 x Power cord 🍕Tips: The amount of water added is related to the type of flour.If no noodles can be squeezed out, this is a situation that add too much water.Please reduce the amount of water.If there is any problem about the pasta maker,please contact us,we are willing to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UyiJHPqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZenStyle","source_asin":"B07QZPFC38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZPFC38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QZPFC38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158457,"name":"Cobalt Bouquet by Sheila Golden, 24x32 inches Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zegbsezYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a bouquet of flowers in a blue vase. Sheila Golden grew up in New York, attending the School of Visual Arts and the New School of the Social Reserach in New York City, then worked in graphic design and illustration. She studied film animation, lithography and ceramics, and received her bacherlor's degree in fine art. While living in California, Sheila started teaching classes on watercolor collage. Sheila has combined her multiple skills and talents to translate her love of nature into painting and collage. Her original watercolors and watercolor collages are exhibited in numeroud juried art shows around the country and her work is represented in private as well as corporate collections in major cities. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zegbsezYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B008OFFUEE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008OFFUEE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008OFFUEE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158458,"name":"Delorean Future Time Machine 18X24\" Poster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tadq64OCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DELOREAN TIME MACHINE CAR POSTER. This handmade poster print is a large 18x24 inches in size including a white border and is ready to frame for display (frame is shown for demonstration purposes and is not included). The artwork is printed on premium archival acid free card stock (10 mil Epson Ultra Premium Archival Paper) with Ultrachrome archival inks (lightfastness: 100+ years). These posters make great conversational pieces and look fabulous framed as decorative wall art. They also make great gifts. The poster will be quickly and safely shipped to you in a heavy-duty Kraft mailing tube with plastic endcaps via USPS Mail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tadq64OCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steves Poster","source_asin":"B01I73X3EQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I73X3EQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I73X3EQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158459,"name":"Steak Knife Set of 8, Non-serrated Steak Knives 4.5-inch with Beech Wood Block, Premium Stainless Steel Table Knife with Ergonomic Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h7aYg1rVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENJOY YOUR COOKING TIME SPECIFICATION: - Color: Black - Main material: German Stainless Steel + ABS Handle - Handle Size: 4.5-inch -Blade Size: 5-inch -Total Size: 9.5-inch PACKAGE INCLUDES: 8x Steak Knives 1x Beech Wooden Block 1x Wipe Cloth USE TIPS: ·Watch out for the sharp cutter edge and eliminate direct hand touch ·Do not use this steak knives on joints, bones, tough forzen meat since the blade is thinner and ultra-sharp ·Do not use on earthenware, glass or porcelain surface Care: ·Hone the knife with honing steel every 2-3 month to maintain its sharpness ·Hand washing the knife with soapy cloth under running water after every use, keep it dry and safe ·Knives that cut through tomatoes, lemons and other acidic foods should be washed with water and dried in time to prevent the from being corroded and rusty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h7aYg1rVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N++A","source_asin":"B09HGNYZNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HGNYZNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HGNYZNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158460,"name":"Melitta 40994 1.7-Liter Kettle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+azAWXrZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Melitta 1.7 liter kettle is made with a premium stainless steel finish and push button lid that opens gently. It's cord free and has a concealed element for easy, drip free pouring. You can feel safe knowing that there's an aoutomatic shutoff with boil-dry protection and an easy cord wind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+azAWXrZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melitta","source_asin":"B00MOS2M3E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MOS2M3E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MOS2M3E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158461,"name":"OneWorld Memorials Branch Ceramic Keepsake Urns - Extra Small - Holds Up to 20 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Sakura Pink Cremation Urn for Ashes - Engraving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tUeKjkhL._AC_.jpg","description":"For a departed loved one who appreciated everything about nature, the earthy OneWorld Memorials Extra-Small Sakura Pink Ceramic Cremation Urn is the perfect way to honor their life. This memorial urn displays cherry blossoms (or sakura) across the entire outer surface, providing a symbol of the beautiful, but fleeting, nature of life and the coming of the glorious spring. Add a customized engraved base at the time of ordering, if desired.Ceramics are made by combining earthenware ingredients, such as clay and powders, with water and molding them into desired forms. Often covered in a waterproof glaze, ceramic pottery is constructed in differing ways. Most often thrown on a potter’s wheel, it can also be hand molded into varied shapes and then fired in a kiln, first to harden the clay into pottery, then to set the glaze and bring out its vibrant colors. Glazes, only after firing, become the spectacular hues seen on each finished product. Artisans train for years to learn the techniques that successfully bring beautiful ceramic pieces into being. With its distinguished and long history, ceramic has enjoyed a development that has shaped it into the expertly crafted material used today. The techniques employed in its use are direct descendants of those invented thousands of years ago, and its evolution has given us the beauty and expert workmanship we see now. Ceramic urns for ashes and cremation pottery are particularly suited to house cremation ashes and are durable and beautiful memorials to a loved one. Often quite unique in their design, the choices available, both in aesthetic and price, are varied and suitable for any taste and budget.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tUeKjkhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B074MKJC9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074MKJC9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074MKJC9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
