window.products.push({"id":1158504,"name":"Universal Headboard or Footboard Hardware Nuts and Bolts 4 inches and 2 1/2\" Long","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JFB4aObRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Headboards or headboards and footboards can be connected in a many different ways, but simply fastening them up with nuts and bolts is one of the easiest and most trouble free methods to attaching them securely. You simply need a steel bed frame with a flat mounting plate. It will either have aligned holes with your headboard or slots that give you more versatility to fit a greater variety of beds and bed heights. Either way you simply align the holes in the mounting plate with the holes in the headboard legs and push correct length bolt through the leg of the bed. Slip the washer over the shank of the bolt and then thread on and tighten the nut. Our complete kit includes 2 different length bolts so you get it right the first time. No need to guess and risk having to return. Why? Because we send you everything you need so you get the correct length the first time. The extras can be used for something else, stored for extra parts or disposed of. The rounded carriage head bolt is does not protrude in back of the headboard eliminating the possibility that the bolt head could cause damage to your plaster, dry wall, or painted wall where a smooth finish is necessary. The square shoulder underneath the rounded head is unique when compared to other bolt heads because this design has the ability to resist turning when the nut is removed or tightened. They are good for wood-to-metal mounting plate connections when the head may not be accessible for tightening. Includes: (4) 4″ Bolts (For thicker headboards) (4) 2½” Bolts (For thinner headboards) (8) Nuts (8) Washers Specs: ¼” x 2½” and ¼” by 4″","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JFB4aObRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STLBEDS","source_asin":"B0773VK1GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0773VK1GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0773VK1GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1158505,"name":"Bath Tub and Shower Mats, XL Bathtub Mat (35'' x 16'') Bathtub Mat Bathtub Safety Matting, Non-Slip with Suction Cups, Machine Washable, Bath, Shower,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whAOwBP7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Hunders of Suction Cups!! Our bath and shower mats feature 324 suction cups that help hold in place on smooth, clean surfaces. This bath mat is a great choice for the home, gym, spa and more! Larger Size and Features Holes: Our extra large and generously sized mat is 35 x 16 inch and provides excellent coverage. Many other mats are smaller leaving areas of your tub exposed. And while other mats are solid creating a moist underside , our mat features small holes throughout to allow water to circulate. BPA Free, Non-Toxic, Phthalate free, Latex Free. Plus, all of our mats come with a 10-Year No Questions Asked Warranty. If you are at all unsatisfied with your product, please contact us (through Amazon if past the standard return window) and we will be happy to assist you. At the end of the day we want our customers to be happy! Our durable mat is machine-washable to facilitate hassle-free maintenance and uphold its fresh appearance. We highly recommend that you wash your mat prior to use. Simply throw the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent (no bleach) and air dry. We recommend rinsing and drying your bath mat periodically to remove oily and slippery buildup that may occur from various soaps and hair products. WARNING: Prevent Falls: Secure suction cups before each use. Mat will only attach to clean, smooth surface. Not for use on textured, tiled, or non-smooth surfaces. Do not use bath oils - may cause slipping","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whAOwBP7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESS","source_asin":"B07PRT16TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PRT16TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PRT16TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
