window.products.push({"id":1158545,"name":"Oregon Scientific RM313PNA_BL Model RM313PNA Projection Atomic Alarm Clock, Indoor Thermometer, HiGlo Electro-luminescent Backlight, Crescendo Alarm w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K2ZQBBV0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Oregon Scientific RM313PNA_BL Model RM313PNA Projection Atomic Alarm Clock, Indoor Thermometer, HiGlo Electro-luminescent Backlight, Crescendo Alarm with Snooze Function, Blue These cool little clocks automatically set to the U.S. Atomic Clock and never need adjusting for Daylight Saving Time. The projection feature offers a unique way to read time in the dark by casting soft glowing red numbers on a wall, ceiling, or just about any surface Key Features Automatically sets itself to the U.S. Atomic Clock, never needs adjusting for Daylight Saving Time Automatically sets itself to the U.S. Atomic Clock, never needs adjusting for Daylight Saving Time Indoor thermometer Indoor thermometer Projects time onto wall, ceiling, or just about any surface Projects time onto wall, ceiling, or just about any surface Illuminated with HiGlo electro-luminescent backlight Illuminated with HiGlo electro-luminescent backlight Crescendo alarm with snooze function Crescendo alarm with snooze function Icon display of U.S. map with designated time zones Icon display of U.S. map with designated time zones Specifications AC adapter included for continuous projection AC adapter included for continuous projection Batteries: 2 AA (Not included) Batteries: 2 AA (Not included) Dimensions: 4.25\" x 2.5\" x 4.5\" Dimensions: 4.25\" x 2.5\" x 4.5\" Indoor Temperature: Yes Indoor Temperature: Yes AC Adapter: No AC Adapter: No Alarm Functions: Yes Alarm Functions: Yes Snooze Function: Yes Snooze Function: Yes Projection Color: Red Projection Color: Red Amazon.com Housed in high-tech blue plastic, this alarm clock is far more sophisticated than its cute appearance may lead one to believe. Whether you check on the time by consulting the clock's LCD screen or by looking at a large red-light projection of the time beamed onto a wall or ceiling, you'll know it's accurate. That's because the clock is equipped with a radio receiver tuned to the U.S. Atomic Clock, and keeps time with split-second accuracy by automatically adjusting, if necessary, to the Atomic Clock's signals six times every 24 hours. From those signals, the 5-1/4-by-4-1/2-inch clock (2-1/2 inches thick) not only shows the precise time, but also displays the date and day, with automatic adjustment for daylight-saving time and leap year, according to the North American time zone for which the clock is set. (The day can be shown in English, Spanish, or French.) The red-light projection makes it possible to check the time without squinting. If the clock is in battery mode (two AA batteries required but not included), pressing the clock's snooze bar will beam the time onto the ceiling for five seconds--and also backlight the LCD screen. If the clock is plugged into a wall socket with an AC adapter (included), the projection and backlighting will be available either for five seconds with the snooze bar or continuously if a continuous-beam control is set. As a backup, you can set the time, day, and date manually as well as automatically. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K2ZQBBV0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oregon Scientific","source_asin":"B01BV3FGV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BV3FGV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BV3FGV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
