window.products.push({"id":1158648,"name":"CONMIXC Stainless Steel Metal Shaker Bottle for Protein Mixes 28oz 800ml, Shaker Cup for Protein Shakes, Leak Proof BPA Free Metal Shake Bottle Cup Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uota7c4hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL METAL SHAKER BOTTLE FOR PROTEIN MIXES. Rather than flimsy plastics, CONMIXC protein shaker bottle body is made in premium 304 food safe stainless steel, built to last. It efficiently mixes protein shakes, protein powders, cold coffee and other supplements, beverages, smoothies, making it perfect for workout, yoga, hiking, biking, sports etc. Bring it to the gym, workout, work and places where the day takes you. 28 OZ/800 ML SHAKER CUP. The protein shaker cup for protein shakes holds 28 OZ/800 ML when filled up full. The measurement markings go to 24oz 700ml though. TIPS: NEVER pour hot water which is above 40 ℃ / 104 ℉ in the protein shake bottle because that might cause huge pressure inside the workout bottle shaker and force the lid open. DUAL MIXING TECHNOLOGY. To achieve quick & sufficient mixing performance, we’ve included 2 mix tools in this shake cups: a removable twist-off grid integrated around the gym shaker bottle mouth area, and a shaker ball inside the bottle. These 2 shaker tools ensure a full and complete mix of proteins or other supplements, so you will always have super smooth drinks every time with this protein powder shaker bottle. LEAK PROOF & BPA FREE. The shake bottle mixer is 100% leak free, even if it’s placed upside down once you’ve twisted on the lid and secure the flip drinking cap (You will hear a crisp click sound.). No more accidental spills or messes in the gym. The shake cup for protein shakes is made in BPA free & food safe stainless steel, ABS, PP. The flip cap makes it super easy for drinking without having to twist off the lid. HANDLE FOR EASY CARRY AROUND. The snap down handle makes it super convenient to carry the protein shake cups around. CONMIXC always stand behind its products and provide 12 months warranty for its protein shaking bottles. Should you have any question or issue with our protein mixer shaker bottle, please feel free to reach out to us and we will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uota7c4hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CONMIXC","source_asin":"B08JTZNNS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTZNNS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTZNNS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
