window.products.push({"id":1158703,"name":"PowerDoF sewing machine CM6626T 12-Cup Glass Carafe Programmable Coffee Maker, regular, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAi-fIBVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With PowerDoF CM6626T Coffee Maker you can enjoy delicious coffee without 15 minute!Specification: Power: 1000W Input voltage: 110-230VAC/50Hz Volume: 1.8L Rated water volume: 1.8L The amount of coffee: 1680ml Coffee cup: Glass Shell: Body / tank / bottom cover / tank cover / funnel frame, PP material, PP matte surface. Dimensions: 10.04*7.87*13.98in Weight: 4.63lbCleaning: 1.Do not forget to remove the plug from the socket before cleaning the appliance. 2.Wipe outside with soft dry cloth when coffee machine is wet, never use metal polish. 3.The removable items should be washed in hot soapy water. Rinse them before fixing. 4.Wash the filter and carafe. 5.Never use dishwasher to clean the jug.Package includes: 1 X coffee maker 1 X Carafe 1 X User manualNotes: 1.The coffee maker will be switched off automatically if brewing exceed 2 hours. 2.The backup power can keep the time in memory of for about 30-sec after losing its electrical power. You have to reset timer after the coffee maker lose the electrical power for 30 sec or more. 3.The coffee maker must be stable when placed on a flat desktop, without shaking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAi-fIBVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PowerDoF","source_asin":"B07M97PFXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M97PFXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M97PFXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
