window.products.push({"id":1158714,"name":"Nirvana Futons Atlantic Cottage Storage Drawers White Futon Frame and Mattress Set - Full Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDbZG2POL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The classic styling of the Cottage collection will give any room a breath of fresh air like the morning ocean breeze. Picket arms remind us of a fence lined beach front, and the fine details of the turned foot accents and arched-crowned moldings simply accentuates the beauty of this futon. A nostalgic piece, the cottage is sure to bring back memories of a forgotten summer or a smile that fills your heart.  •   Set includes futon frame, futon drawers, futon mattress, and Atlantic futon cover - pillows not included •   Sofa height seating •   Flip up arms provide hidden storage •   Futon drawers freely roll under the frame for quick and easy storage •   Full size futon set easily converts into a standard full size sleeper (60\"W x 79\"D) •   Satin white finish applied by expert artisans •   Eco-friendly futon frame uses only hardwoods from sustainable plantations •   Finished wooden seat and back decks for a superior product and increase attractiveness •   8\" thick futon mattress provide a medium to firm support •   Futon mattress made with multi layer of poly-cotton and four layers of high density foam •   Futon mattress and futon cover are made in the USA •   Tufted futon mattress - prevents shifting and lumping of the internal contents •   Frame, drawers, mattress, and cover ship separately and may arrive at separate times •   Four year limited manufacturer's warranty •   Futon frame and drawers crafted in Indonesia •   Assembly required •   Recommended Cover Care: Machine washable with cold water and hang dry, no dryer  DIMENSIONS: Sofa: 82.75\"W x 38\"D x 33\"H Bed: 82.75\"W x 54\"D x 23.75\"H Arm Height: 23.75\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDbZG2POL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nirvana Futons","source_asin":"B01MAUO1PJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MAUO1PJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MAUO1PJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
