window.products.push({"id":1158766,"name":"143Pcs Flamingo Tropical Balloons Arch and Garland Kit, Decorations for Hawaiian Luau Summer Theme Jungle Party, Baby Shower Wedding Birthday Bachelor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+N432NXEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do you want to have a perfect party? Do you ever have a thought to be the star of your friends? We sincerely provide a set of creative balloons design for you, which will bring more happiness for your coming party. Package Including: -Gold pineapple balloons: 2pcs -Pink pineapple balloons: 1pcs -Montera delicosa liebm: medium-8pcs, small-8pcs -Yellow balloons: 18”-2pcs, 12”-10pcs, 5”-10pcs -Coralline balloons: 24”-2pcs, 10”-10pcs -Rose red balloons: 10”-10pcs, 5”-10pcs -Fruit green balloons: 12”-10pcs, 5”-10pcs -Gold metallic balloons: 10”-10pcs, 5”-15pcs -Turquoise balloons: 12”-10pcs -Bottle-green balloons: 12”-10pcs How to Creat a Balloon Garland Chain Step 1: Inflate all the balloons with balloon pump then tie knots, recommend various colors and blow up different sizes to get a amazing look to your garland. Step 2: Measure and cut balloon strip to desired length, leave extra on each end for hang the decoration later. Step 3: Insert the balloon knot into the hole of the balloon chain strip,then shift the knot to the smaller side. Continue the process till all balloons are used Step 4: Make more gorgeous looking, add some eucalyptus, curling ribbon, flowers, leaves, tulle and more. Step 5: After finish the whole balloon chain,use the dot glue to fix it in place. Please Note! There is an error of 1-5 cm in manual measurement, please understand. Photographic lighting problems, physical and photographic differences may exist, please take physical as the standard. Fill the balloon with air or helium, NOT hydrogen to avoid bursting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+N432NXEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHUOLIN","source_asin":"B08RXRVSGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RXRVSGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RXRVSGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
