window.products.push({"id":1158803,"name":"ILAVIE Espresso Coffee Machine with Steamer, 20 Bar Espresso Maker with Milk Frother Steam Wand, Espresso and Cappuccino Maker, Easy to Use at Home, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dk7BkGx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【20 Bar High Pressure System】: ILAVIE Espresso Machine is equipped with a 20 bar high pressure pump and a 1250w powerful heating system, which ensures the fastest and best extraction of espresso, makeing espresso more fragrant and rich in cream, it's convenient to make Latte and Cappuccino and another espresso at home or office, 25-45s quick brewing time, even if you are in a hurry to work, you have plenty of time to make a cup of coffee. 【Professional Milk Frothing System】: Built-in a stainless steel milk frother wand, which can release hot steam or hot water to create rich and smooth foaming for latte cappuccino, can be used as an espresso coffee machine, cappuccino machine and latte machine. The compact design makes this small espresso machine suitable for any size kitchen. 【Automatically Flow Stop Design】: Designed with volume control, one press to start and it will automatically flow stop according to dispensed amount of espresso, you could customize your preferred amount of espresso by pressing the one/two cups button, one cup for 30-45ml and two cups for 60-90ml. It's easy to operate, even beginners can make great coffee. 【Practical& Detachable Accessories】: 900ML large capacity water tank allows you to brew multiple espresso without refilling, you could see the water level, and the tank is easy to remove and refill. The removable drip tray allows you to use a larger cup. The top of the machine features a practical function for warming up the cup so that you can always enjoy the feeling of freshly brewed coffee. Removable accessories for easier cleaning. 【Warm Tips & 12-Monthy Warranty】This product is for 120V/60HZ ONLY! Using any kind of adapter/converter with the machine may cause a malfunction of your unit! Please follow the quick start guide (included in the package) for the first time use of the machine. Any questions, please feel free to contact our after-sales team first, we provide one-year warranty and 24-hour after-sales service a day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dk7BkGx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ILAVIE","source_asin":"B0BZVDLM5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1158803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVDLM5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVDLM5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
